warning[ban-concurrent-index-creation-in-transaction]: `drop index concurrently` can't run inside a transaction
  ╭▸ 
3 │ drop index concurrently i;
  │            ━━━━━━━━━━━━
  │
  ╰ help: drop the index outside any transactions
warning[ban-concurrent-index-creation-in-transaction]: `reindex concurrently` can't run inside a transaction
  ╭▸ 
4 │ reindex index concurrently i;
  │               ━━━━━━━━━━━━
  │
  ╰ help: reindex outside any transactions
warning[ban-concurrent-index-creation-in-transaction]: `reindex concurrently` can't run inside a transaction
  ╭▸ 
5 │ reindex (concurrently) table t;
  │          ━━━━━━━━━━━━
  │
  ╰ help: reindex outside any transactions
warning[ban-concurrent-index-creation-in-transaction]: `detach partition concurrently` can't run inside a transaction
  ╭▸ 
6 │ alter table t detach partition p concurrently;
  │                                  ━━━━━━━━━━━━
